      "sourceTextSha256": "3659d046979a9142ce79f11518b7157d03e7a7a4dc3721f2f89b17527de9b330",
      "text": "Four-hour group city tour and visit to Sugarloaf Mountain with an English-speaking guide.\nWe’ll head to Praia Vermelha, or Red Beach, where you’ll take the cable car up to Sugarloaf Mountain. The first stop is Morro da Urca, which has a broad viewing platform. A smaller platform at the top of Sugarloaf overlooks Rio, Copacabana Beach, the bay, the surrounding mountains, islands in the ocean, the bridge to Niterói and the Christ the Redeemer statue.\nThen you’ll visit the historic centre of Rio to see old churches and monasteries, the city’s main cathedral and buildings in the colonial style.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw8xmmzc-4ws6bwp2vxe",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      }
    },
